Product data derived from DummyJSON
-----------------------------------
data/seed/products.json and data/seed/categories.json are derived from the product data of DummyJSON
(https://dummyjson.com, project: https://github.com/Ovi/DummyJSON by Muhammad Ovi), retrieved on 2026-10-27 with
tools/fetch_dataset.py and then selected, regrouped into departments and edited (see data/seed/SOURCES.md). The
`rating` and `review_count` values are not from DummyJSON; they are derived from the review-service seed.

